tween mainly Catholic nationalists and republicans seeking a united Ireland and mainly…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/troupes-de-la-marine"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/troupes-de-la-marine.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Troupes de la Marine</span><span class="enc-type">People / group</span><span class="enc-snip">The Troupes de la Marine were independent companies of infantry under the French Ministry of the Marine, raised to defend France's colonies and naval ports.</span></a></li></ul>
